<title>UK: London precious metals end lower, interest falters.</title>
<headline>London precious metals end lower, interest falters.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Closed at $381.10/$381.60, down 60 cents from Thursday. Disappointed market with poor follow-through to silver's bounce Thursday. Producer selling held top in Far East. Drifted easier.</p>
<p>SILVER - Finished at $5.01/$5.03 up a cent. Failed to get through Thursday's high. Drifted towards $5.00, may go lower.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Ended at $385.50/$386.50 vs $388.25/$389.25.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Closed down $0.50 at $117.25/$118.25.</p>
</text>
